# Copy this file to .npmrc (gitignored) and replace the placeholder tokens
# with real values from your account. Never commit `.npmrc` itself — it is
# present in `.gitignore` for that reason.
#
# FontAwesome Pro — required to install @fortawesome/pro-* packages.
# Token is per-account. Get yours at https://fontawesome.com/account
@fortawesome:registry=https://npm.fontawesome.com/
//npm.fontawesome.com/:_authToken=YOUR_FONTAWESOME_PRO_TOKEN
